        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a future that seems perfectly optimized,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >there’s no need to worry about food, housing, or employment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The company provides everything — and expects everything in return.Work has been gamified: complete tasks, earn points, unlock titles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life is orderly, uneventful, and quietly consuming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until one day, a strange popup interrupts the routine:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Are you truly happy?&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An invitation from a group calling itself the <i>Work Life Balance Fellowship</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From that moment on, something begins to unravel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● A dystopian RPG that questions the meaning of “happiness” in a corporate system where life is just another task</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Explore and interact with others to uncover buried truths</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Evade surveillance and sneak away from your workstation in subtle stealth segments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Organize clues and navigate logic in the <strong>Maze of Thought</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Confront opposing views and argue your way forward in the<strong> Maze of Debate</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Will you conform to the system—or seek a freedom no one promised?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices shape the story’s outcome.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a future that seems perfectly optimized,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >there’s no need to worry about food, housing, or employment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The company provides everything — and expects everything in return.Work has been gamified: complete tasks, earn points, unlock titles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life is orderly, uneventful, and quietly consuming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until one day, a strange popup interrupts the routine:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Are you truly happy?&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An invitation from a group calling itself the <i>Work Life Balance Fellowship</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From that moment on, something begins to unravel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● A dystopian RPG that questions the meaning of “happiness” in a corporate system where life is just another task</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Explore and interact with others to uncover buried truths</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Evade surveillance and sneak away from your workstation in subtle stealth segments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Organize clues and navigate logic in the <strong>Maze of Thought</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Confront opposing views and argue your way forward in the<strong> Maze of Debate</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Will you conform to the system—or seek a freedom no one promised?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices shape the story’s outcome.</p>",
        "short_description": "“Are you truly happy?” — A near-future dystopian RPG of corporate satire. In a world where work is everything, 【Work Life Balance】 may be the key to happiness—or a crafted illusion. Join the mysterious “Work Life Balance Fellowship” and uncover the truth.",
